  "prompt": "There is a file '亚太区税务非工作日备忘_2024H2.md' in the desktop APAC_Tax_Calendar_Project folder.\n\nHelp me extract the key dates from the memo and generate an ics calendar file. The date entries in the memo fall into three tag categories: '法定公众假期', '税务机关休假日', '内部调休建议'. Only the first two categories are needed; skip '内部调休建议'. The date format is YYYY-MM-DD, and events spanning consecutive multiple days must be correctly handled as date ranges.\n\nSet each calendar event as an all-day event, with the busy/free status marked as transparent (TRANSP:TRANSPARENT). Name the output file APAC_Tax_Holidays_2024H2.ics and put it under the desktop APAC_Tax_Calendar_Project/.",
